{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/2hq1k2lzss00nubculxfq7ha9n7kfx0.mp3","text":"没问题，博士，我就待在你身边。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/g727apk31xifrwrymzw1stij2k33e07.mp3","text":"滑行的时候瞄准？很简单啊，想学吗？来，扶着我的手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/d8zk71hqgcux2ulwcneiz2dik5dg1c1.mp3","text":"以前我和很多朋友一样都以标新立异为荣，等到真成了感染者，发现这一点也不酷。生活应该由自己掌握，而不是那么点源石粉尘。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/4u8o0nhfx2bcnt3e4kgg7wgu68ig9sb.mp3","text":"用弩的技巧是个老警察教我的，滑板的技巧是他的女儿教我的，至于二者怎么结合起来的......这就叫无师自通吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/6bkk0ava5p3leql1p1wea209b6t9pa7.mp3","text":"不要误会，滑板只是爱好的一部分......也是我找到自我的第一个途径，之后的精彩才是重头戏，想听吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/a81o5xkj1m0w3uqrhdfw2fua0zo37sa.mp3","text":"为什么要成为作战干员......？博士，你觉得那些嘻嘻哈哈的“街头混混”最看重的是什么？当然是自由，我乐意为自由而战，所以我为罗德岛而战。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/kj5r26i16wtp57o2rh8l78k2rsv1nrv.mp3","text":"成为感染者的遗憾有很多，比如我在公园的涂鸦才刚到一半，比如现在吃不到那个老警察独家配方的洋葱圈，嗯？仅此而已哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/toyukff9myxhyzo9v1ashhlrct1p5p1.mp3","text":"我是抱着治病的心态来到罗德岛的，本来以为会是个到处都是消毒水味，也不让人随意走动的地方......结果还真出乎预料，就是舰内不允许涂鸦，不过伊桑他......不，没什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/hzva99lcya3keafpl7h3i53ddqe50cq.mp3","text":"我在汉堡甜甜圈套餐，滑板和街舞比赛里找到了解放自己的方法，你呢，博士？太累了的话，来找我和红豆她们，就当......玩耍吧。玩耍是天性，是很重要的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/eix92ges93xg9ef2dc1rmi50d3qne0q.mp3","text":"累了就休息吧，还有我在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/op5hn6lj3281ui3uc3tj3ssvgz91m78.mp3","text":"干员，酸糖，这块滑板是登记的装备，嗯，有什么问题尽管交给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/0ao25hap0928yapaz870a4e5c2y965d.mp3","text":"还真酷。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/eyn9gdqe1nq8muzstjwsp5kci6xxbi7.mp3","text":"晋升吗，谢谢你。上一次这样还是在磐蟹杯上拿奖的时候吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/i8warxdmsmjfjb66i8kwcr105uczhmz.mp3","text":"那个老家伙教我用弩的初衷只是在混乱的街区里保护自己，谁想得到会有这一天呢，为感染者自由而战的这一天。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/22fa1s8ujtqxksqcviiafx73appoz7n.mp3","text":"得令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/2b18mpi2a7qk9s82qf80ygu0sd1fh1q.mp3","text":"团队合作也是得分的重点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/8v0h3oq1dyj484wsiawf2udc2mrehnu.mp3","text":"出发。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/l0vwy9l2qmm1gtuhenpx28c89bxe3ae.mp3","text":"发现敌人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/nmtsxfrpjhcgpxrot6376pf02itcdrd.mp3","text":"我在这。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/7v4hnmynnwzvu99seov0bwrb3jgkast.mp3","text":"说吧，怎么对付他们？","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/0b1klseo903y9wn2tmhcnt506ykrbrt.mp3","text":"真让人跃跃欲试啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/h97bcgsbgdugbqyvmyhv7rcia2ipjuy.mp3","text":"漂亮的地形。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/dsn4v9jxj65p6ggq9u1te7r65ywxfyc.mp3","text":"跳吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/9te8wyhdu30oczeeuoz72rh6cgi0r7j.mp3","text":"炫技时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/i25t2a74psxwvv1rhif3vqih3a2njh8.mp3","text":"我在这儿喔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/9iytv386o40de2zh0vdeavo7si6acxv.mp3","text":"空翻，然后命中。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/j2269z5a0cnooianatnlbypiyf7o336.mp3","text":"辛苦了，博士......啊，回去之后陪我换两颗螺丝钉吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/qz00zwsjqvd3uu88s9hekdu0d6uqs14.mp3","text":"挑战成功的瞬间永远是最有自豪感的，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/akcf5uga5r32b7gmg6rtbmnjh0cs3tc.mp3","text":"要追吗？我的话，追得上。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/57aps6ne3h3adqg7pcaj1g617ozzmcw.mp3","text":"唔，这种低级的动作失误......","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/3kpuez3attf6ueyua2f1dk1ja3od3wt.mp3","text":"这块墙很适合......不，我什么都没说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/7v6c58iu4xdricwzbjv48lq2k4ywcp1.mp3","text":"唔哇！","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/8iz0j7yibrygu36fqpqu8pv5zovgy0v.mp3","text":"要一起去小卖部吗？如果路上我没有一次失误，请我喝果汁。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/t4lsmtdlj1xoh0mr4arccbj8agn7tod.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/rxg0tfbz5os5e51trjspj4s0hsk0x19.mp3","text":"啊，博士，新年快乐！一会儿我们还有个街头聚会，你也该来试试身手了吧？这次就尝试一下街舞怎么样？不难的，我教你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/6lhe4f7lxbnslbhob6779npxmyga9gf.mp3","text":"哟，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_366_acdrop/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/3lybepknl7fajuxigx7b4aueewc4a30.mp3","text":"没问题，博士，我就待在你身边。","alt":"voice/char_366_acdrop/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/kr1oroi6bm0jkmpnx1inoyng8j018ha.mp3","text":"滑行的时候瞄准？很简单啊，想学吗？来，扶着我的手。","alt":"voice/char_366_acdrop/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/mlujbpe46ta2r5jw6h3r4irlw6rhk0z.mp3","text":"以前我和很多朋友一样都以标新立异为荣，等到真成了感染者，发现这一点也不酷。生活应该由自己掌握，而不是那么点源石粉尘。","alt":"voice/char_366_acdrop/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/07jwapcugzf73z910d8pi3coiczp8fh.mp3","text":"用弩的技巧是个老警察教我的，滑板的技巧是他的女儿教我的，至于二者怎么结合起来的......这就叫无师自通吧。","alt":"voice/char_366_acdrop/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/4mp1fp5bgpooxrk3il7pjihvupvgkua.mp3","text":"不要误会，滑板只是爱好的一部分......也是我找到自我的第一个途径，之后的精彩才是重头戏，想听吗？","alt":"voice/char_366_acdrop/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/3ozac7vakpp4h64og18jyg5ooc8c90r.mp3","text":"为什么要成为作战干员......？博士，你觉得那些嘻嘻哈哈的“街头混混”最看重的是什么？当然是自由，我乐意为自由而战，所以我为罗德岛而战。","alt":"v